---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About Elias Velasquez | Systems Engineer & Full-Stack Developer"
  description="Biography and technical experience of Elias Velasquez Fuentes - Systems Engineering student at Universidad de Cartagena and Freelance Web Developer."
>
  <main class="page-container about-hero">
    <div class="section-tag">
      <span class="tag-code" aria-hidden="true">&lt;/&gt;</span>
      <span data-en="About Elias Velasquez" data-es="Sobre Elias Velasquez">About Elias Velasquez</span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="page-title">
      <span data-en="Systems Engineer &" data-es="Ingeniero de Sistemas y">Systems Engineer &</span>
      <strong data-en="Full-Stack Developer." data-es="Desarrollador Full-Stack.">Full-Stack Developer.</strong>
    </h1>

    <p class="page-description" data-en="Final-year Systems Engineering student at Universidad de Cartagena. Experienced in building high-performing web platforms for major brand experiences, user reservation flows, and full database integrations." data-es="Estudiante de último año de Ingeniería de Sistemas en la Universidad de Cartagena. Con experiencia construyendo plataformas web de alto rendimiento para eventos de marca, flujos de reserva e integración de bases de datos.">
      Final-year Systems Engineering student at Universidad de Cartagena. Experienced in building high-performing web platforms for major brand experiences, user reservation flows, and full database integrations.
    </p>

    <!-- Stat Highlights -->
    <div class="stats-grid">
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-number">2021-Pres.</div>
        <div class="stat-label" data-en="Universidad de Cartagena" data-es="Universidad de Cartagena">Universidad de Cartagena</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-number">Adidas</div>
        <div class="stat-label" data-en="Freelance Event Projects" data-es="Proyectos Freelance de Marca">Freelance Event Projects</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-number">3x AWS</div>
        <div class="stat-label" data-en="Academy Graduate Certs" data-es="Certificaciones AWS Academy">Academy Graduate Certs</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="stat-number">B2 / Nativo</div>
        <div class="stat-label" data-en="English & Spanish" data-es="Inglés y Español">English & Spanish</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bio & Professional Focus -->
    <div class="about-content-grid">
      <div class="bio-card">
        <h3 data-en="Professional Profile" data-es="Perfil Profesional">Professional Profile</h3>
        <p data-en="I am a front-end and full-stack web developer driven by fast-paced learning and delivering clean, efficient software within tight deadlines. My technical foundation spans modern front-end tools like Astro, TypeScript, and Sass, paired with backend technologies including Node.js, Supabase, and PostgreSQL." data-es="Soy un desarrollador front-end y full-stack orientado al aprendizaje rápido y a entregar software eficiente dentro de plazos ajustados. Mi base técnica abarca herramientas front-end modernas como Astro, TypeScript y Sass, combinadas con backend en Node.js, Supabase y PostgreSQL.">
          I am a front-end and full-stack web developer driven by fast-paced learning and delivering clean, efficient software within tight deadlines. My technical foundation spans modern front-end tools like Astro, TypeScript, and Sass, paired with backend technologies including Node.js, Supabase, and PostgreSQL.
        </p>
        <p data-en="In my freelance work, I have engineered full web platforms for Adidas launch events ('Original Forever' and 'Hotel Superstar'), streamlining attendee entry, eliminating queuing bottlenecks, and centralizing scheduling and database confirmations." data-es="En mi experiencia freelance, he desarrollado plataformas web completas para eventos de Adidas ('Original Forever' y 'Hotel Superstar'), agilizando el ingreso de asistentes, eliminando filas y centralizando la gestión de reservas e itinerarios.">
          In my freelance work, I have engineered full web platforms for Adidas launch events ('Original Forever' and 'Hotel Superstar'), streamlining attendee entry, eliminating queuing bottlenecks, and centralizing scheduling and database confirmations.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="principles-wrapper">
        <div class="principle-card">
          <div class="principle-icon">01</div>
          <div class="principle-info">
            <h4 data-en="Fast-Paced Delivery" data-es="Entrega Rápida y Eficiente">Fast-Paced Delivery</h4>
            <p data-en="Proven ability to build and deploy production-ready web apps under tight event deadlines." data-es="Capacidad comprobada para desarrollar y desplegar aplicaciones web para eventos con plazos ajustados.">Proven ability to build and deploy production-ready web apps under tight event deadlines.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="principle-card">
          <div class="principle-icon">02</div>
          <div class="principle-icon-tech" data-en="Astro & Sass" data-es="Astro y Sass">Astro & Sass</div>
          <div class="principle-info">
            <h4 data-en="Modern Front-End Stack" data-es="Stack Front-End Moderno">Modern Front-End Stack</h4>
            <p data-en="Building lightweight, accessible, zero-JS-by-default websites using Astro, TypeScript, and structured Sass." data-es="Desarrollando sitios web ligeros y accesibles utilizando Astro, TypeScript y Sass estructurado.">Building lightweight, accessible, zero-JS-by-default websites using Astro, TypeScript, and structured Sass.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="principle-card">
          <div class="principle-icon">03</div>
          <div class="principle-info">
            <h4 data-en="Full Database Integration" data-es="Integración de Base de Datos">Full Database Integration</h4>
            <p data-en="Architecting schemas, authentication flows, and real-time backend connections with Supabase and PostgreSQL." data-es="Diseñando esquemas, autenticación y conexiones en tiempo real con Supabase y PostgreSQL.">Architecting schemas, authentication flows, and real-time backend connections with Supabase and PostgreSQL.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- AWS Certifications Section -->
    <section class="skills-section">
      <div class="section-tag">
        <span class="tag-code" aria-hidden="true">&lt;AWS_CERTS/&gt;</span>
        <span data-en="AWS Academy Certifications" data-es="Certificaciones AWS Academy">AWS Academy Certifications</span>
      </div>

      <div class="skills-grid">
        <div class="skill-category-card">
          <h4>AWS Cloud Architecting</h4>
          <p style="color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 12px;" data-en="Amazon Web Services Training & Certification - Graduate" data-es="Capacitación y Certificación AWS - Graduado">Amazon Web Services Training & Certification - Graduate</p>
          <div class="tags-list">
            <span class="tech-pill">Cloud Infrastructure</span>
            <span class="tech-pill">VPC & Security</span>
            <span class="tech-pill">High Availability</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="skill-category-card">
          <h4>AWS Data Engineering</h4>
          <p style="color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 12px;" data-en="Amazon Web Services Training & Certification - Graduate" data-es="Capacitación y Certificación AWS - Graduado">Amazon Web Services Training & Certification - Graduate</p>
          <div class="tags-list">
            <span class="tech-pill">Data Pipelines</span>
            <span class="tech-pill">S3 & Databases</span>
            <span class="tech-pill">Analytics</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="skill-category-card">
          <h4>AWS Cloud Developing</h4>
          <p style="color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 12px;" data-en="Amazon Web Services Training & Certification - Graduate" data-es="Capacitación y Certificación AWS - Graduado">Amazon Web Services Training & Certification - Graduate</p>
          <div class="tags-list">
            <span class="tech-pill">Serverless & Lambda</span>
            <span class="tech-pill">RESTful APIs</span>
            <span class="tech-pill">Deployment</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Technical Skills Matrix (Applied Experience) -->
    <section class="skills-section">
      <div class="section-tag">
        <span class="tag-code" aria-hidden="true">&lt;TECHNICAL_SKILLS/&gt;</span>
        <span data-en="Technical Stack" data-es="Habilidades Técnicas">Technical Stack</span>
      </div>

      <div class="skills-grid">
        <div class="skill-category-card">
          <h4 data-en="Front-End" data-es="Front-End">Front-End</h4>
          <div class="tags-list">
            <span class="tech-pill">Astro</span>
            <span class="tech-pill">JavaScript</span>
            <span class="tech-pill">TypeScript</span>
            <span class="tech-pill">Sass / SCSS</span>
            <span class="tech-pill">HTML5</span>
            <span class="tech-pill">CSS3</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="skill-category-card">
          <h4 data-en="Backend & Databases" data-es="Backend y Bases de Datos">Backend & Databases</h4>
          <div class="tags-list">
            <span class="tech-pill">Node.js</span>
            <span class="tech-pill">Supabase</span>
            <span class="tech-pill">PostgreSQL</span>
            <span class="tech-pill">SQL</span>
            <span class="tech-pill">REST APIs</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="skill-category-card">
          <h4 data-en="Tools & Version Control" data-es="Herramientas y Control de Versiones">Tools & Version Control</h4>
          <div class="tags-list">
            <span class="tech-pill">Git</span>
            <span class="tech-pill">GitHub</span>
            <span class="tech-pill">Netlify</span>
            <span class="tech-pill">VS Code</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Education & Freelance History -->
    <section class="timeline-section">
      <div class="section-tag">
        <span class="tag-code" aria-hidden="true">&lt;EDUCATION_EXPERIENCE/&gt;</span>
        <span data-en="Education & Experience" data-es="Educación y Experiencia">Education & Experience</span>
      </div>

      <div class="timeline">
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-date">2021 - PRESENT</div>
          <h4 class="timeline-role" data-en="Ingeniería de Sistemas (Systems Engineering)" data-es="Ingeniería de Sistemas">Ingeniería de Sistemas</h4>
          <div class="timeline-company">Universidad de Cartagena — Cartagena, Colombia</div>
          <p class="timeline-desc" data-en="Final-year student specializing in software engineering, database design, system architecture, and full-stack web development." data-es="Estudiante de último año enfocado en ingeniería de software, diseño de bases de datos, arquitectura de sistemas y desarrollo web full-stack.">
            Final-year student specializing in software engineering, database design, system architecture, and full-stack web development.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-date">FREELANCE</div>
          <h4 class="timeline-role" data-en="Front-End / Full-Stack Freelance Developer" data-es="Desarrollador Front-End / Full-Stack Freelance">Front-End / Full-Stack Freelance Developer</h4>
          <div class="timeline-company">Brand Event Platforms (Adidas Launch Events)</div>
          <p class="timeline-desc" data-en="Developed reservation and event experience web platforms for Adidas ('Original Forever' & 'Hotel Superstar'), connecting custom front-end interfaces to Supabase and PostgreSQL backend databases." data-es="Desarrollo de plataformas web de reservas para eventos de Adidas ('Original Forever' y 'Hotel Superstar'), conectando interfaces front-end personalizadas a bases de datos en Supabase y PostgreSQL.">
            Developed reservation and event experience web platforms for Adidas ('Original Forever' & 'Hotel Superstar'), connecting custom front-end interfaces to Supabase and PostgreSQL backend databases.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
